<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ACIL says raises Ibstock stake.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ACIL says raises Ibstock stake.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brierley Investments Ltd's Australian Consolidated Investments Ltd (ACIL) said on Friday it had increased its stake in the British building materials and forest products group, Ibstock Plc, to 21.4 percent.  </p>
<p>On September 4, ACIL said it had a 20.55 percent stake in Ibstock Plc.</p>
<p>ACIL is 96.1 percent owned by Brierley.  </p>
<p>Ibstock reported a drop in interim pretax profits to 2.4 million stg from 14 million stg on turnover of 115.1 million stg versus 122.1 million a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
